meta {
  name: 02_RequestValidation
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Scenario: The system user package request rejects invalid input and ineligible callers

    When the organisation number is malformed the request fails with 400
    When the organisation number has an invalid checksum the request fails with 400
    When no organisation has the organisation number the request fails with 400
    When the system user belongs to an organisation that is not KOMM, FYLK or STAT the request fails with 403
    When the token lacks the system user requests scope the request fails with 403
    When no token is provided the request fails with 401

  No step creates state, so the scenario needs no cleanup.
}
